مُّبِينٍ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"Do they have a ladder to climb, in order to eavesdrop [on Heaven’s secrets]? Let their eavesdropper produce clear proof.","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"أَمْ","en_gloss":"Or","transliteration":"am","verse_key":"52:38"},{"pos":2,"ar":"لَهُمْ","en_gloss":"for them","transliteration":"lahum","verse_key":"52:38"},{"pos":3,"ar":"سُلَّمٌۭ","en_gloss":"(is) a stairway","transliteration":"sullamun","verse_key":"52:38"},{"pos":4,"ar":"يَسْتَمِعُونَ","en_gloss":"they listen","transliteration":"yastamiʿūna","verse_key":"52:38"},{"pos":5,"ar":"فِيهِ ۖ","en_gloss":"therewith","transliteration":"fīhi","verse_key":"52:38"},{"pos":6,"ar":"فَلْيَأْتِ","en_gloss":"Then let bring","transliteration":"falyati","verse_key":"52:38"},{"pos":7,"ar":"مُسْتَمِعُهُم","en_gloss":"their listener","transliteration":"mus'tamiʿuhum","verse_key":"52:38"},{"pos":8,"ar":"بِسُلْطَـٰنٍۢ","en_gloss":"an authority","transliteration":"bisul'ṭānin","verse_key":"52:38"},{"pos":9,"ar":"مُّبِينٍ","en_gloss":"clear","transliteration":"mubīnin","verse_key":"52:38"},{"pos":10,"ar":"٣٨","en_gloss":"(38)","transliteration":"","verse_key":"52:38"}]},{"verse_key":"52:39","surah":52,"ayah":39,"ar_uthmani":"أَمْ لَهُ ٱلْبَنَـٰتُ وَلَكُمُ ٱلْبَنُونَ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"Does God have daughters while you have sons?","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"أَمْ","en_gloss":"Or","transliteration":"am","verse_key":"52:39"},{"pos":2,"ar":"لَهُ","en_gloss":"for Him","transliteration":"lahu","verse_key":"52:39"},{"pos":3,"ar":"ٱلْبَنَـٰتُ","en_gloss":"(are) daughters","transliteration":"l-banātu","verse_key":"52:39"},{"pos":4,"ar":"وَلَكُمُ","en_gloss":"while for you","transliteration":"walakumu","verse_key":"52:39"},{"pos":5,"ar":"ٱلْبَنُونَ","en_gloss":"(are) sons","transliteration":"l-banūna","verse_key":"52:39"},{"pos":6,"ar":"٣٩","en_gloss":"(39)","transliteration":"","verse_key":"52:39"}]},{"verse_key":"52:40","surah":52,"ayah":40,"ar_uthmani":"أَمْ تَسْـَٔلُهُمْ أَجْرًا فَهُم مِّن مَّغْرَمٍ مُّث