":"yuṣ'ʿaqūna","verse_key":"52:45"},{"pos":8,"ar":"٤٥","en_gloss":"(45)","transliteration":"","verse_key":"52:45"}]},{"verse_key":"52:46","surah":52,"ayah":46,"ar_uthmani":"يَوْمَ لَا يُغْنِى عَنْهُمْ كَيْدُهُمْ شَيْـًٔا وَلَا هُمْ يُنصَرُونَ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"the Day when their snares will be of no use to them, when they will get no help.","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"يَوْمَ","en_gloss":"(The) Day","transliteration":"yawma","verse_key":"52:46"},{"pos":2,"ar":"لَا","en_gloss":"not","transliteration":"lā","verse_key":"52:46"},{"pos":3,"ar":"يُغْنِى","en_gloss":"will avail","transliteration":"yugh'nī","verse_key":"52:46"},{"pos":4,"ar":"عَنْهُمْ","en_gloss":"to them","transliteration":"ʿanhum","verse_key":"52:46"},{"pos":5,"ar":"كَيْدُهُمْ","en_gloss":"their plotting","transliteration":"kayduhum","verse_key":"52:46"},{"pos":6,"ar":"شَيْـًۭٔا","en_gloss":"(in) anything","transliteration":"shayan","verse_key":"52:46"},{"pos":7,"ar":"وَلَا","en_gloss":"and not","transliteration":"walā","verse_key":"52:46"},{"pos":8,"ar":"هُمْ","en_gloss":"they","transliteration":"hum","verse_key":"52:46"},{"pos":9,"ar":"يُنصَرُونَ","en_gloss":"will be helped","transliteration":"yunṣarūna","verse_key":"52:46"},{"pos":10,"ar":"٤٦","en_gloss":"(46)","transliteration":"","verse_key":"52:46"}]},{"verse_key":"52:47","surah":52,"ayah":47,"ar_uthmani":"وَإِنَّ لِلَّذِينَ ظَلَمُوا۟ عَذَابًا دُونَ ذَٰلِكَ وَلَـٰكِنَّ أَكْثَرَهُمْ لَا يَعْلَمُونَ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"Another punishment awaits the evildoers, though most of them do not realize it.","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"وَإِنَّ","en_gloss":"And indeed","transliteration":"wa-inna","verse_key":"52:47"},{"pos":2,"ar":"لِلَّذِينَ","en_gloss":"for those who","transliteration":"lilladhīna","verse_key":"52:47"},{"pos":3,"ar":"ظَلَمُوا۟","en_gloss":"do wrong","transliteration":"ẓalamū","verse_key":"52:47"},{"pos":4,"ar":"عَذَابًۭا","en_gloss":"(is) a punishment","transliteration":"ʿadhāban","verse_key":"52:47"},{"pos":5,"ar":"دُونَ","en_glo